(7728152, 1271955, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Nothing "accidental" or "found" about this, but a lovely image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I certainly see what you are saying, given the shape was created but at the time of capture making an A wasnt at all part of the brief. When the challenge was announced, I went through my portfolio of model images looking for images/poses that looked like letters. In that respect, I definitely found it!</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Nothing "accidental" or "found" about this, but a lovely image.   I certainly see what you are saying, given the shape was created but at the time of capture making an A wasnt at all part of the brief. When the challenge was announced, I went through my portfolio of model images looking for images/poses that looked like letters. In that respect, I definitely found it!', '2022-08-19 01:27:43.000000', NULL, 0),
